{
	"info": {
		"name": "Cinema Multi-Sala API",
		"description": "API completa per la gestione di un cinema multi-sala.\n\n## 🚀 Quick Start\n1. Avvia l'applicazione: `./mvnw spring-boot:run`\n2. Esegui **Login Customer** (o Admin/Manager)\n3. Il token JWT viene salvato automaticamente\n4. Testa tutte le altre API!\n\n## 👥 Utenti Pre-caricati\n- **CUSTOMER**: customer@example.com / customer123\n- **MANAGER**: manager@cinema.com / manager123\n- **ADMIN**: admin@cinema.com / admin123\n\n## 🔐 Permessi\n- **ADMIN**: Accesso completo a tutto\n- **MANAGER**: Gestione Film, Proiezioni, Sale\n- **CUSTOMER**: Prenotazioni e Recensioni",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "userId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login Customer",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", jsonData.token);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", jsonData.id);",
									"    console.log(\"✅ Token saved! User: \" + jsonData.email + \" Role: \" + jsonData.role);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"customer123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Login Manager",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
